              <panel_51b8dd15a7655ed4a2ed6bf2e5103126 dorExcludeDescription="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guidePanel" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="PN_StaticText_0d377488" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/panel" textIsRich="true" validateOnStepCompletion="{Boolean}false">
                <items jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2">
                  <textdraw_3b6cae54286e4a5fa093afbc261619cc _value="<p>Since your contract refers to a benchmark within the meaning of Article 3(1)(3) of Regulation (EU) 2016/1011 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 8 June 2016, we are legally obliged to provide you with information on the name of the benchmark and of its administrator as well as the potential implications on you (Article 247 Section 4(3) of the introductory Law to the German Civil Code (Einführungsgesetz zum Bürgerlichen Gesetzbuch)).</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_SinceYourContractRefersToA_923bfaf6" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_066c554738344f9d8800a0f822ec19b2 _value="<p>In the financial sector, there are various common reference interest rates. Interest on the current account through which you receive credit or on your loan may make reference to the following reference interest rates:</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_InTheFinancialSectorThereAre_0a471a13" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_47db059794284f69b36696db88190f13 _value="<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\"><li>€STR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>€STR stands for euro short-term rate and refers to an overnight rate administered by the European Central Bank (ECB). €STR reflects the unsecured overnight borrowing costs of banks in the Eurozone and takes account of wholesale transactions of banks with financial counterparties, such as insurance companies. €STR is calculated for every TARGET2 business day on the basis of transactions that were conducted and concluded on the previous day and is made available, at the latest, by 9:00 a.m. CET of the following day on the ECB&#39;s website.</li></ul></li><li>SARON<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>SARON (Swiss Average Overnight Rate) is a secured overnight rate that is based on repo transactions in Swiss francs (CHF). SARON is calculated continuously in real time by SIX Swiss Exchange as a volume-weighted average interest rate and is published every 10 minutes. In addition, fixing is carried out three times a day at 12:00 noon, 4:00 p.m. and 6:00 p.m. The 6:00 p.m. fixing serves as the reference for derivative financial products and the valuation of financial assets.</li></ul></li><li>SOFR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The Secured Overnight Financing Rate (SOFR) is a secured interbank overnight interest rate. SOFR is based on transactions in the US Treasury repo market, where banks and investors borrow or lend money overnight secured by US government bonds. SOFR is published for every trading day in the US Treasury market at around 8:00 a.m. Eastern Time on the following day (D+1).</li></ul></li><li>SONIA<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>SONIA (Sterling Overnight Index Average) is a reference interest rate that is intended to measure the interest paid on short-term wholesale deposits in pound sterling if credit, liquidity and other risk factors are minimal. SONIA is calculated based on the interest rates for unsecured overnight transactions, which are reported daily to the Bank of England.</li></ul></li><li>TONAR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>TONAR (Tokyo Over Night Average Rate) is a weighted average rate for all unsecured overnight transactions. The interest rate is published on the same day on a provisional basis using the reported transactions. The final result is available on the following day (D+1) at around 10:00 a.m. JST.</li></ul></li><li>EURIBOR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>EURIBOR (Euro Interbank Offered Rate) is an average rate at which banks based in the European Economic and Monetary Union area are prepared to lend money to one another in euros.</li></ul></li><li>LIBOR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>LIBOR (London Interbank Offered Rate) is the interest rate at which selected banks based in the financial center of London are prepared to lend money to one another. LIBOR is currently determined for five different currencies (USD, GBP, EUR, JPY, CHF) and seven different durations.</li></ul></li></ol>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_Str_1bced4e7" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_f84469ae636d40a09531fac9542ac5d5 _value="<p>Following the announcement by the British Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) in 2017 that it would no longer oblige banks to continue to submit LIBOR data after 2021, LIBOR is highly likely to cease at the end of the year 2021.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_FollowingTheAnnouncementByThe_b5437847" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                <layout columns="1" dorLayoutType="columnar" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" nonNavigable="{Boolean}true" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2" toolbarPosition="Bottom">
                <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                  <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
              <panel_6a69a0d69794554a9d37b879d89d89e1 dorExcludeDescription="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guidePanel" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" jcr:title="2. Administrators" name="PN_2Administrators_ef79c46eTitle" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/panel" textIsRich="true" validateOnStepCompletion="{Boolean}false">
                <items jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2">
                  <titledraw_f470ae4206a749a8aa4a6cde4fe68e92 _value="<p>2. Administrators</p>\n" css="stepTitle" dorExclusion="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" headingLevel="2" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="TTL_2Administrators_ef79c46e" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/titledraw" summaryExclusion="true" textIsRich="true">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                <layout columns="1" dorLayoutType="columnar" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" nonNavigable="{Boolean}true" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2" toolbarPosition="Bottom">
                <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                  <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
              <panel_c0a5022bfafc550f98f11ca03ae5328b dorExcludeDescription="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guidePanel" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="PN_StaticText_cfb94f23" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/panel" textIsRich="true" validateOnStepCompletion="{Boolean}false">
                <items jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2">
                  <textdraw_ad4acdf89818533f9d812c3271feb09d _value="<p>Administrators exercise control over the provision of reference interest rates, manage the mechanisms for their determination and publish them.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_AdministratorsExerciseControl_0a1d60a5" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_60a7be054b5f539fb588ca0659836723 _value="<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\"><li>€STR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The administrator of €STR is the European Central Bank.</li></ul></li><li>SARON<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The administrator of SARON is SIX Repo AG.</li></ul></li><li>SOFR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The administrator of SOFR is the Federal Reserve Bank of New York.</li></ul></li><li>SONIA<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The administrator of SONIA is the Bank of England.</li></ul></li><li>TONAR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The administrator is the Bank of Japan.</li></ul></li><li>EURIBOR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The administrator of EURIBOR is the European Money Markets Institute.</li></ul></li><li>LIBOR<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><li>The administrator of LIBOR is Intercontinental Exchange Benchmark Administration Ltd.</li></ul></li></ol>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_Str_f80d6739" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                <layout columns="1" dorLayoutType="columnar" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" nonNavigable="{Boolean}true" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2" toolbarPosition="Bottom">
                <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                  <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
              <panel_c77adfff7fdd5bf98452afb36e13d1b9 dorExcludeDescription="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guidePanel" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" jcr:title="3. Possible effects on the borrower" name="PN_3PossibleEffectsOnTheBorrower_0a6c855bTitle" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/panel" textIsRich="true" validateOnStepCompletion="{Boolean}false">
                <items jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2">
                  <titledraw_fb02e0c6cfa845bfa2b87eaa08198671 _value="<p>3. Possible effects on the borrower</p>\n" css="stepTitle" dorExclusion="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" headingLevel="2" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="TTL_3PossibleEffectsOnTheBorrower_0a6c855b" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/titledraw" summaryExclusion="true" textIsRich="true">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                <layout columns="1" dorLayoutType="columnar" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" nonNavigable="{Boolean}true" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2" toolbarPosition="Bottom">
                <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                  <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
              <panel_a4ac1df75f1957eaafcdbb8119b14d1c dorExcludeDescription="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guidePanel" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="PN_StaticText_3dca8914" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/panel" textIsRich="true" validateOnStepCompletion="{Boolean}false">
                <items jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2">
                  <textdraw_58957157a15a5f7089ba6be27929c616 _value="<p>Your agreement contains an initial contractual interest rate at which the current reference interest rate plus a premium, also called margin or nominal premium, is agreed upon when the agreement is concluded. The time and amount of the interest rate change are linked to the change in the reference interest rate, which means the loan interest is reviewed regularly (e.g. every three months) on the basis of the development of the reference interest rate and is adjusted if necessary.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_YourAgreementContainsAn_c340e7cc" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_9e76438c41b35725b809f5466b2a88d6 _value="<p>With a reference interest rate-based borrowing rate, you therefore bear the interest rate risk – with the result that your monthly charge may also increase or decrease considerably, depending on how the reference interest rate is currently developing. The exact nature of a reference interest rate is explained above under the keyword &quot;reference interest rates&quot;.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_WithAReferenceInterestRate_f6b74d08" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_c2e9828c944351e9b726c92dc87ce627 _value="<p>Should the calculation principles change for a reference interest rate or if it can no longer be ascertained temporarily or permanently, we will – taking into account all legal and contractual provisions – take a different, suitable reference interest rate as the basis. We will, of course, then inform you of this reference interest rate. Should a contractual adjustment be impossible or be unreasonable for one party, each contractual party is entitled to cancellation without notice for good reason. The contract will be wound up in an appropriate period.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_ShouldTheCalculation_bf9d4bb2" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                <layout columns="1" dorLayoutType="columnar" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" nonNavigable="{Boolean}true" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2" toolbarPosition="Bottom">
                <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                  <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
            <layout columns="1" dorLayoutType="columnar" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" nonNavigable="{Boolean}true" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2" toolbarPosition="Bottom">
            <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
